<section image-layout="blank" id="VtBnZfD_1x"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="V1SnVOAtTh"><p role="eyebrow">Illustrative example · Not portfolio data</p><h2>Exposure action map: plan, act, monitor, verify</h2><freeform-block w="840" h="300"><box type="content" w="420" h="144" sizing="fixed" locked="true" background-color="rgba(45,111,142,0.07)"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="420" w="420" h="144" sizing="fixed" locked="true" background-color="rgba(182,78,60,0.10)"><p></p></box><box type="content" y="144" w="420" h="144" sizing="fixed" locked="true" background-color="rgba(93,102,107,0.05)"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="420" y="144" w="420" h="144" sizing="fixed" locked="true" background-color="rgba(40,122,114,0.07)"><p></p></box><shape preset="line" w="840" h="2" locked="true" stroke="neutral-border" stroke-width="1"></shape><shape preset="line" y="288" w="840" h="2" locked="true" stroke="neutral-border" stroke-width="2"></shape><shape preset="line" w="2" h="288" locked="true" stroke="neutral-border" stroke-width="2"></shape><shape preset="line" x="838" w="2" h="288" locked="true" stroke="neutral-border" stroke-width="1"></shape><shape preset="line" x="420" w="2" h="288" locked="true" stroke="neutral-border" stroke-width="1"></shape><shape preset="line" y="144" w="840" h="2" locked="true" stroke="neutral-border" stroke-width="1"></shape><box type="content" x="16" y="8" w="260"><p font-size="14pt"><b>PLAN / RESERVE</b></p></box><box type="content" x="436" y="8" w="220"><p font-size="14pt"><b>ACT NOW</b></p></box><box type="content" x="16" y="152" w="200"><p font-size="14pt"><b>MONITOR</b></p></box><box type="content" x="436" y="152" w="380"><p font-size="14pt"><b>VERIFY / DEFER IF MATERIAL</b></p></box><box type="content" x="104" y="42" w="300" h="90" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-3" style="padding: 8pt 10pt;"><h4 font-size="16pt">PLAN · HFC</h4><p font-size="16pt">HFC-heavy supermarket estate<br>U3 · M4 · Plan capex</p></box><box type="content" x="524" y="42" w="300" h="90" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-2" style="padding: 8pt 10pt;"><h4 font-size="16pt">ACT NOW · ODS</h4><p font-size="16pt">Legacy-ODS cold store<br>U4 · M4 · <b>Reserve + engage</b></p></box><box type="content" x="104" y="186" w="300" h="90" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 8pt 10pt;"><h4 font-size="16pt">MONITOR · INDIRECT</h4><p font-size="16pt">Landlord-controlled HVAC<br>U1 · M1 · Monitor</p></box><box type="content" x="524" y="186" w="300" h="90" sizing="fixed" background-color="palette-1" style="padding: 8pt 10pt;"><h4 font-size="16pt">VERIFY · UNKNOWN</h4><p font-size="16pt">Older fire suppression<br>U3 · M2 · Defer if material</p></box></freeform-block><p font-size="16pt"><b>Illustrative holdings and scores:</b> U = urgency; M = materiality; 5 = highest. Action categories are illustrative; confirm all five coordinates before action.</p></grid-item></grid></section>